    "updated_at": "2016-11-09T20:14:08Z",
    "body": "So we specifically moved to the current setup as the result of my suggestions in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/1063#issuecomment-210852397, to avoid the extra HTTP request. I guess I didn't think that the common case was not needing a redirect; my usage patterns very often necessitate a redirect. I am still not very sure, but it sounds like you are, so I'm happy to let you take the lead on this...\n",
